# Preserve reviewed source and scientific artifact checksums across platforms.
# The 2.0.0 tests check line endings: *.cmd and the Chinese text files are CRLF,
# *.sh, *.service and the Python/JS/CSS sources are LF. Nothing is converted.
* -text
*.h5 binary
*.npy binary
*.zcos binary
*.ttf binary
*.png binary

# Treat preserved Windows CRLF line endings as valid whitespace.
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol

# GitHub language statistics: vendored and generated code, design notes and guides.
pc/vendor/** linguist-vendored
mega/source/** linguist-generated
legacy/instrument-control/firmware/stm32/Drivers/** linguist-vendored
docs/** linguist-documentation
*.html linguist-documentation
